  key: firstOpening
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Alright - that's just about everything we need to cover on the first day!
  - If you ever forget what to do, be sure to consult the checklist - it will automatically
    update and let you know the tasks that must be completed before the museum can
    be opened for the day.
  - Now that you've got a handle on all the core requirements of the job, let's open
    this thing up to the public!
  - Go ahead and unlock the door so visitors can start seeing all the beautiful works
    on display - they may even learn a thing or two!
  outlineTag: museumOpen
